{
  "name": "pointer-mouse-owner-last-active",
  "description": "mouse_owner last-active: the first mouse record claims the one mouse, another source's motion and releases are dropped (mouse-not-owner), its press takes over after releasing the previous owner's buttons (canceled); touches stay multi-source with per-source index ranges (source b's index 0 is host index 32); close gives the mouse up.",
  "config": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "recv": {
        "type": "hello",
        "format": "gsw-input/1",
        "source": "a",
        "epoch": 1
      },
      "channel": "a"
    },
    {
